The Competitor library is an early-development part of Clario, with scanning through the **Apify API**. It brings creative records, advertiser matching and source details into the review, where records can be checked, verified or discarded before they support a brief.

Seeing an ad in a public library shows what a competitor is running; it does not establish their CPA, ROAS or profitability. I use those records to develop hooks, creative angles and tests for our own work. The preview below uses fictional records to illustrate the interface.
